		<description><![CDATA[Mahbood Don was a fabulous friend, hilarious, curious, open, adventuresome, a dedicated father of two and a grandfather to a bunch, and forever-loving husband (to Magdalena Gilmary) and an all-around good guy. He was part of the Arica community in Spokane and the Sufi community and the Band of Brothers of Brother Joe who met in the Spokane/Coeur d&#039;Alene area every year for many years.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Mahbood Don was a fabulous friend, hilarious, curious, open, adventuresome, a dedicated father of two and a grandfather to a bunch, and forever-loving husband (to Magdalena Gilmary) and an all-around good guy. He was part of the Arica community in Spokane and the Sufi community and the Band of Brothers of Brother Joe who met in the Spokane/Coeur d&#8217;Alene area every year for many years.</p>
